WEBVTT

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:05.330
The hospital!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.410
An ambulance!

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:07.540
And we should tell the staff-

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:08.980
Wait!

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.590
Jeez, come on, you two.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:16.760
I just tripped.
Don't make a big deal out of it.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.220
But just now, you looked like
you were in a lot of pain-

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:20.970
It doesn't hurt. It doesn't hurt!

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:23.010
I'll be fine with a good night's sleep.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.000
Really?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.430
Of course!

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:28.630
Besides, if we make a big deal out of it,
the staff will be worried.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.630
So keep this a secret!

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.650
Come on, don't make that face!

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.430
Tomorrow, I'll be able
to dance like I always do!

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:43.950
I hope so...

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:44.690
Yeah...

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.380
I'm fine...

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.210
I'm just imagining it...

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:54.450
It doesn't hurt.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:57.380
It doesn't hurt at all.

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:04.960
I mean, if I can't dance, then all the hard work
the three of us put in will be for nothing.

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:40.610
All right! I'll work hard in today's lesson, too!

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.900
Good morning!

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:46.720
Morning!

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.940
Morning, you two!

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.560
One, two! One, two!

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:59.570
One, two, step!

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.070
Okay, turn!

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:05.420
Ow...

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:08.790
lchigo-san, weren't we supposed
to jump there and make a big turn?

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.500
Oh, was that what it was? Sorry.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:16.500
Now, let's try again from the same place!

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.430
Hey, Futaba, what are you doing?

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:23.070
What's the matter, Futaba-san?

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.170
Sit down.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:26.490
Wh-What is it?

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:27.760
Just sit down.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:33.190
I knew it.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:35.620
lchigo-san, that's...

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:41.700
Mornin'! Working hard today, too, huh?

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.800
Yes, we're full of energy!

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.120
The choreography is finally
starting to take shape, too!

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:50.180
Oh? That's wonderful.

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:53.120
Then, I've got a surprise
present for you good girls!

00:03:57.530 --> 00:04:00.470
They're your stage clothes! I had them made!

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.770
Th-They're so cute!

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:05.650
You had them made?
Just for us? With original designs?

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:07.470
We'll be wearing them?

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:09.320
That's right!

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:11.320
The only three in the world!

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:12.480
And they cost-

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:13.980
50,000 yen?!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.580
No. 500,000 yen.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.610
5... 500,000?!

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:23.610
Th-They're that expensive?!
50... What...? 500,000...?!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.500
It's fine, it's fine.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:28.620
I'm looking forward to seeing
the three of you dance in these.

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:33.300
Leave it to us!

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:35.540
We'll dance with everything we've got!

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:40.310
I knew I could count on you.
I'm looking forward to seeing you three dance!

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:46.430
Well, do your best with practice, you three!

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.050
Okay!

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.200
lchi-

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:50.810
Wait!

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:54.410
I can put a compress on it or tape it.
There are a lot of different things I can do!

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:56.280
So keep my foot a secret!

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:56.880
But-

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:00.440
He has such high hopes for us.
I can't tell him that my foot hurts.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:05.210
If I can't dance, then we have to redo
the set list from the beginning.

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:08.200
All the dances you two learned
will go to waste, too.

00:05:10.570 --> 00:05:12.720
I can't cause you two trouble.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.460
I can't betray Kaibara-san's hopes, either.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.880
No matter what happens, I'll see this through!

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:21.740
So...

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:24.380
Don't tell anyone...

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.880
Promise.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:35.690
I wonder if lchigo's really all right.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:39.160
Will she really be able to do the concert?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:45.750
But like lchigo said,
if we tell the staff about her foot,

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:49.920
everything the three of us did for
the last few months will be for nothing.

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:51.950
They even had clothes made for us.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:52.880
kodomo no koro akogareta monogatari no naka muteki no hiiroo
The invincible hero you admired in stories as a child

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.470
I'm sure the quality of the concert will also...

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:57.210
kodomo no koro akogareta monogatari no naka muteki no hiiroo
The invincible hero you admired in stories as a child

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.700
Winter Anison: Special Appearance
by Horie Yui!

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:02.890
kodomo no koro akogareta monogatari no naka muteki no hiiroo
The invincible hero you admired in stories as a child

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:10.170
senobi shite mo ima wa mada kimi no te wa todokanai keredo
Even if you stretch, you cannot reach him

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:13.250
Can we really continue like this...?

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.180
With lchigo overdoing it...?
dekiru? dekinai? shi-
Can you do it, or not? Do-

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.940
Japanese Confectionery Kohana-ya

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:22.040
We will go into your ears...

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.580
Ichigo-san...

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.590
Good morning.

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:46.310
Oh, good morning.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:48.650
I am Ichinose Futaba from Aozora Production.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:50.230
I look forward to working with you today.

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:54.600
Good morning. I'm Horie Yui.
I look forward to working with you, too.

00:06:57.340 --> 00:07:00.190
I see. It was on TV, huh?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.040
Thanks for watching it.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.180
Sure.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:07.360
Um...

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:11.590
This is on a completely
different scale from yours,

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:14.200
but we also have a concert coming up.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:18.140
Oh, for the group you're in
with Moesaki-san, Earphones?

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:18.800
Yes.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:20.600
You must be excited.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:27.440
More than excited, I'm just worried that
I'll mess up the words or the choreography...

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:31.590
I always write them down
in a notebook to remember.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:34.350
I just keep scribbling down the lyrics.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:35.530
Huh?!

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:39.350
There's so much to do for a concert.
You must be busy.

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:44.080
How do you feel right before
the curtain goes up?

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.110
Hm? Um...

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:49.120
Lonely, maybe?

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:54.870
Once the curtain goes up, you can't stop
until it's over, no matter what happens.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.120
I feel like I'm going to be
crushed by that pressure...

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:03.370
Even if I choke or fall,
no matter what happens...

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:08.230
Once the performance begins,
I have to take care of it by myself.

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:12.380
By myself...

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:17.760
Well, once you get on stage,
the audience is there, so you forget all that.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:21.070
lchinose-san, is this your first time in a unit?

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.910
Oh, y-yes, it is.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:28.270
Really? I'm in a unit, too, you know.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.280
Units are nice, aren't they?

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:37.300
I mean, no matter what you feel,
you can split it between all the members.

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:41.120
The pressure, the happiness, the pain...

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:45.170
You know what? I love being in a unit!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.920
Let's do our best
at the dance lesson.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:58.440
Morning!

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:00.110
Good morning!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.310
Oh, Futaba, you're here early.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.310
Futaba...?

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:09.320
lchigo, I was thinking about it,

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.210
and I think we should tell everyone
about your injured foot after all.

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:12.820
What?

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:15.710
Our practice will be even harder starting today.

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:20.170
But with your foot, you won't
be able to practice, let alone perform.

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:21.830
Futaba-san...

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:25.600
That's why we should change
the set list and do fewer dances-

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.710
I can do it!

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:29.140
I said I'd do it no matter what, right?

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:34.470
I can't let all our hard work
go to waste just because of a sprain...

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:40.220
If you won't tell them, then I will.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:42.780
We're putting on this concert together.

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:46.480
You're not the one who gets to decide
if we keep it a secret or not.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.280
Wai-

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.960
What's your deal, Futaba?

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:55.100
U-Um...

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:59.340
I think... that's better, too.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:09:59.990
Huh?

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.180
I think Futaba-san wasn't sure
what would be best either.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:08.880
She had the hardest time with the dances
and put in the most time practicing.

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:14.260
Besides, she learned your dancing and
singing parts too so she could help you...

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:16.010
Futaba...

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:19.570
She's okay with all her
hard work going to waste.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.760
That's how much she's
concerned about your foot-

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:23.350
Morning!

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:27.410
I saw Futaba-chan go out just now.
Did something happen?

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:31.200
Kaibara-san.

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:32.860
Hm? What's wrong?

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:36.040
I... got injured.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:38.210
I might not be able to dance.

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:39.570
Sorry I didn't say anything!

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:44.580
What, that's all it was?

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:51.330
What? Injured?! Postpone the concert?!
Or cancel it?! Which means bankruptcy?!

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:55.840
What'll I do? I don't know,
I don't know, I don't know!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:56.080
What kind of respon-

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.300
lt'll be fine!
What kind of respon-

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:57.580
What kind of respon-

00:10:58.270 --> 00:10:59.400
It'll be fine.

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:03.050
Even if we run into trouble,
the three of us make up one unit.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:06.350
If we help each other, the concert
will definitely be successful.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:07.310
We'll make it successful!

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:08.640
Futaba...

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:09.500
Futaba-san!

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:12.410
What? But lchigo-chan can't move, right?

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:15.250
There's no such thing as a performance
where one person just stands there!

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:20.600
And the choreography, set list, lighting,
art-everything has to be redone!

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:21.000
Oh, the time that'll take!
And the choreography, set list, lighting,
art-everything has to be redone!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.440
Even if you don't move that much,
Oh, the time that'll take!

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:22.590
I think there are ways to make
the performance look good.
Oh, the time that'll take!

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:24.830
The quality will go down!
My golden years will...
I think there are ways to make
the performance look good.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:25.830
The quality will go down!
My golden years will...

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:30.350
For example, for slow songs, I think
it's okay if we sit in chairs and sing.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:33.830
I'm sure the audience will want
to listen to some songs calmly.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.340
In chairs...

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:39.940
And even without footwork, there are dance
moves that look showy using just your arms.

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:42.340
Rin-chan and I can just move around more!

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:44.430
That's right!

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:50.890
If we put lchigo-san in the center and dance for
her on the sides, I think that would work, too!

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:52.620
Dance for me?

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:55.400
I watched a bunch of concert DVDs for research.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.290
The dances might have to change,

00:11:57.290 --> 00:12:01.290
but there are lots of ways to have a
fun concert without cutting out songs!

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:02.460
Right, lchigo?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:05.410
If we work together,
I'm sure we can do it, Ichigo-san!

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:12.240
If you say so...

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:15.290
Yay!

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:16.660
Yay, yay!

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:26.230
Sorry. Thanks, you two.

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:29.820
I'll go to the clinic and
have them tape my foot tightly

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:31.590
so that it won't come off even if I move.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:33.850
Okay!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.680
There's a clinic around the corner.
Ah! Uh...

00:12:35.680 --> 00:12:37.860
That's right.
Huh? Huh?

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.870
Okay, I'll be back then!

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.860
I'm glad it's not broken.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.620
Thanks to this taping,
I can move a little, but...

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:50.390
But it looks...

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:52.020
...kind of pitiful.

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:52.870
Sorry...

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:56.810
Oh no! The audience'll
be able to tell in a second!

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:59.520
And those clothes that I splurged big time on...

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.520
Oh, Kaibara-san!

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:06.920
A-Anyway, let's think about the dance first.

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:09.920
That's right.
In order to make it easier for lchigo-san,

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:13.930
let's make all the jumps we had into sidesteps.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:17.410
Okay. I should be able to do that.

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:19.710
Sidesteps are easy, right?

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:21.920
All right, let's get practicing!

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:22.380
Yeah!

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:22.760
Yes!

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:27.700
One, two! One, two!
One, two! One, two!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:32.040
One, two, sidestep!
One, two, sidestep!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:36.510
Uh... Wait! My body will learn it soon!

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:39.500
Soon? Our concert is in three days!

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:42.980
I'll do it right next time!

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:44.050
Please do!

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:48.440
One, two! One, two!

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:51.030
Futaba-san, you jumped again!

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.810
I'm sorry...!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.980
With this...

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:13.990
What's wrong? For the Earphones,
after rain comes fair weather, right?

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:17.850
But it's like we jumped out of
the frying pan and into the fire.

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:20.970
There are a lot of things to remember
with the changes to the choreography and all.

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:23.500
I know fear is worse
than the danger itself, but...

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:26.670
There's no use crying over spilt milk.
It'll work out somehow!

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:29.770
That doesn't sound like it'll work out.

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:31.740
Rome wasn't built in a day!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.680
Look! Good fortune comes to those who laugh!

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:38.190
That's it, Sayo-chan!

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:42.620
No! You have to use a proverb or idiom
when you talk! That's the rule!

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:47.440
Um... um... I think I've figured out
how to clean up the spilt milk!

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:51.530
Sayo-chan made these to cheer us on!

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:55.010
Everyone's design is different!

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:57.640
I'm sure these will look great on stage!

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:01.290
W-We're going to wave
these around... and dance?!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:06.060
Don't worry! We'll try to think of easy
movements that even you can do, Futaba-san!

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.020
That even I can do...?

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:11.550
Don't worry about it.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:12.850
And-

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:16.520
One, two, three! One, two, three!

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:19.830
Wait! My body will learn it soon...

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:25.540
With that, we've decided
what to do for all the new dances.

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:26.530
All that's left is-

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:29.430
The clothes, right...?

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:35.530
Yeah, it's a skirt, so my foot
will definitely stand out like this...

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.010
Good morning!

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:37.790
Hm?

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:42.540
Um, I have a suggestion
if you are willing to hear it...

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.050
The cord's not connected!

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:56.950
Today's finally the day!
Five hours until the concert!

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:58.030
That's right!

00:15:58.030 --> 00:16:01.070
Rehearsal, meeting,
changing, hair and make-up...

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:02.700
Ah, I'm so nervous!

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:03.920
All right, we've gotta go!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:06.750
Ow...

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:08.040
Huh? Another injury?

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:10.630
Ah, it's no good!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:11.340
The concert has to be canceled now!

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:14.590
l-l'm fine! There's nothing wrong!
The concert has to be canceled now!

00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:15.370
R-Really?

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:17.380
Are you really all right?

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.750
We sold almost all the tickets,
so please be careful.

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:20.590
What?

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:21.640
When did that happen?

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.930
Well, they sold little by little every day...

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:27.000
There are only about
twenty tickets left for sale today.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:30.020
That's practically a full house!

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:32.010
Yay! That's amazing!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:37.400
Sorry! Somehow, it's gotten interesting.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:38.260
Interesting?

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:43.520
Yeah, I mean, I... <i>we</i> will be performing a
concert in front of five hundred people!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.260
Futaba-san...

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:57.530
Now, the most important thing is
to conceal the taping on lchigo-san's foot.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:17:01.470
With that in mind, I thought about
making it stand out instead.

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:06.700
These clothes were used for the show
at Aozora Production's New Year's party.

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:10.750
These <i>do</i> hide it, but...

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.600
It's true that if we leave it at that,

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:15.510
the leg warmers are so big,
they make things unbalanced.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.080
Which is where these come in.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:17.700
Eh?

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:21.360
W-Will those be all right?

00:17:21.360 --> 00:17:24.160
Will the audience tell us
to stop messing around...?

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:24.820
Hey.

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:27.160
Let's all wear these.

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:32.230
Blue for Rin-chan, pink for lchigo,
and yellow for me.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.070
Wh-What are these for?

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:36.860
I bought them. They're good luck charms.

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:39.170
Futaba...

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:40.320
Even though you're poor.

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:42.870
Don't call me poor!

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:47.960
We've watched a lot of our senpai
at different studios and stuff, right?

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:49.810
That's when I realized

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:54.800
pros are the ones who overcome their
loneliness and worries and move forward.

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:59.820
We're still inexperienced and mess up
a lot and run into problems,

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:05.060
but even so, we leave our homes with resolve.
We go to work with resolve.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:09.310
Whether it's at a recording studio
or at a concert hall, it's the same.

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:13.210
That's why we should use that determination
to see things through to the end!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:15.070
That's what it means to be a professional seiyuu!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:27.510
B-But are you really, really okay?

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.720
We're fine!

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:31.000
Leave it to us!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.530
All right, I'm leaving it to you!

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:37.000
Yes, sir.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:57.660
Earphones, please stand by.

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.030
It's finally time for the concert!

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:01.280
It's our...

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:03.280
...first concert!

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.580
Everyone, let's go!

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:13.100
We're Earphones!

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:25.950
Oh, no...

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.850
These clothes are...

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:30.190
Futaba!

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:32.290
Rin-chan!

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:33.200
lchigo!

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:34.100
So cute!

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:35.140
Don't tell me...
So cute!

00:19:35.140 --> 00:19:35.410
Don't tell me...

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:37.190
They like it?

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:41.450
Rin-chan!

00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:43.950
All right...

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:47.430
Let's start Earphones' first concert!

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:09.220
mimi no naka e ai ni yukimasu
We will go into your ears to meet you

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:13.610
komaku no doa wo nokku shite dokitto suru hodo otonari ni
Knocking on the door of your eardrums, so close we'll make you jump

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.110
Rin-chan..

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:17.980
kimi wa kizuitenai dake da yo
You just haven't realized

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:21.220
naite bakari no chiisana sono senaka ni
You're always crying, but you'll see

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.710
hora ne hane ga aru
There are wings on your small back

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:28.170
namida wo fuitara kao wo agete
So dry your tears and lift your face

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:42.020
Everyone, thank you!

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:43.820
See you later!

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:50.950
Encore! Encore!

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:52.890
Encore!

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:57.040
Encore! Encore!

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:59.070
E-Encore!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:02.880
Encore! Encore!

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:05.070
Encore!

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:08.210
This encore will finally be our last song!
Encore! Encore!

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:09.760
Yeah, let's do our best!
Encore! Encore!

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:10.600
Hey-

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:17.710
I... just for this song... Just for the
last song, I want to dance with my all!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:19.390
Huh? But-

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:20.980
Is your foot okay?

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:24.150
Yeah! Thanks to you two, my foot doesn't hurt.

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:25.970
If it's just for one song, I can dance!

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:28.990
Okay.

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:30.720
Let's go!

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:35.870
Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:21:38.550 --> 00:21:44.540
kono de te mirai wo kaerunda chousen shiyou yo
Let's try changing the future with these hands

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:49.700
hikari no saki e tobidasou
Let's fly to the end of the light

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:56.210
Thanks for the encore-berry!

00:21:56.210 --> 00:22:02.060
arata no suteeji e tobidashita kedo ne
Even though we flew to a new stage

00:22:02.060 --> 00:22:06.420
tachi wa tagaru kabe jouzu mae ni susumenai
There's a wall blocking the way, and we can't move forward

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:07.570
Futaba!

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:12.470
norikoeta saki ni egao ga aru nara
But if there are smiles waiting when we climb over it

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:17.560
donna tsurai shiren demo ganbatte miru yo
Then we'll do our best no matter how difficult the trials

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:18.230
Rin-Rin!

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:20.750
genjitsutte kibishii...
Reality is harsh...
lchigo! lchigo!
lchigo! lchigo!

00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:23.440
dakara gooru wa mabushii
That's why the goal is blindingly bright
lchigo! lchigo!
lchigo! lchigo!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.000
akiramecha dame da!
Don't give up!
lchigo! lchigo!
lchigo! lchigo!

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.750
Don't give up!
akiramecha dame da!

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:34.950
omoikitte yuuki dashite dekiru koto zenbu yatte mireba
If we draw up all our courage and try doing everything we can

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:39.930
mirai wa irodzuki kagayaku
Then the future will take on color and sparkle

00:22:39.930 --> 00:22:42.770
gamusharatte tsutawarunda
People can tell when we work hard

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:46.510
daremo mitenai tokoro demo
Even if we do it when no one's around

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:53.220
tobira no mukou deaeru egao no tame ni
We do it for the smiles we'll meet on the other side of the door

00:23:20.220 --> 00:23:23.500
We'll remember tonight
for the rest of our lives!

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:26.520
Thank you so, so much!
